-- Owner 2026-10-20: the deadline calculator's starting data.
-- Court holidays: federal days (5 U.S.C. § 6103) for 2026-2027 with the
-- observed day when one falls on a weekend; states are added in the admin.
-- Rules: federal court and agency deadlines from the cited rules, and the
-- general personal-injury limitation period of every state. The state
-- periods are from public summaries and are NOT marked verified: the app
-- always tells people to check with the court or the statute.


